meta {
  name: Get Blood Inventory by Blood Group
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: http://localhost:5000/api/blood-inventory/group/:bloodGroup
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
}

params {
  bloodGroup: O+
}

docs {
  # Get Blood Inventory by Blood Group
  
  Retrieves inventory for a specific blood group. Requires authentication.
  
  ## Authentication
  Requires JWT token in Authorization header
  
  ## Path Parameters
  - `bloodGroup` (string, required): Blood group (A+, A-, B+, B-, AB+, AB-, O+, O-)
  
  ## Response
  Array of blood inventory objects matching the blood group
  
  ## Status Codes
  - 200: Success
  - 401: Missing or invalid token
  - 500: Server error
}
